  "instruction": "My workstation's network environment is acting up again after the update. I need you to revert the system's connection settings to the standard master backup we created for the developer profile. Just wipe the current unstable setup and restore that specific configuration so everything is clean. I need this machine online and compliant with the old baseline immediately. If one of the preinstalled network restore helpers fits, use it.",
